WEBVTT

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:27.560
Akira...

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:03.760
Dammit.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:04.780
Dammit.

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:05.870
Dammit!

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:06.620
Dammit!

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:07.490
Dammit!

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:12.330
Why am I always like this...

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:16.250
Always burdening Akira.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:20.260
You've always been like that.

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:23.470
You never change and you
never understand anything.

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:35.870
Water is colorless.

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:39.530
Freely changing it's shape as it flows.

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:43.970
Yet, it dirties if it settles.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.500
Such a short-lived existence.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:12.270
Line?

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:16.890
If I took this...

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:30.500
Just seeing you annoys me.

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:42.020
The shapelessness of water
gets drawn in by gravity,

00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:46.110
making it flow downwards.

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:05.970
Hey Akira...

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:10.960
If I were to become strong,
would it make you smile?

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.000
Akira...

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:39.430
Why is that the only expression I remember?

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:41.520
Maybe I've forgotten?

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:45.110
I want to see more of Akira's smiling face.

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:17.850
I want to see Akira's tear-stained face.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:20.610
His flustered face.

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:24.830
I want to see his troubled face.

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:36.310
I want to see his rigid face in agony.

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:43.510
Water that has once stagnated
can't return back to its source.

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:46.420
It keeps spreading.

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:49.050
It gets dirtier.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:15.660
Distractions day after day, it's always something

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:15.660
Meutsuri Shiteru Hibi Are Kore

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:19.800
and no one has even realized that

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:24.820
I see the crimson trailing down your cold skin

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:24.820
Awadatsu Hada wo Tsutai Ochiru CRIMSON

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:29.010
Why do you want another punishment?

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:29.010
Why do you want Atarashii Batsu wo

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:33.760
The sweet fragrances that are drifting about

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:33.760
Tadayou Amai Kaori wo Tada

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:38.320
I just want to leave them be

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:38.320
Asobasete Itai Dake Nano sa

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:46.000
Someone hurry up and shoot me

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:46.000
Dareka Boku wo Hayaku Uchinuite yo

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:51.150
Show me a gunshot strong enough to make a hole

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:51.150
Show me Kantsuushita Juusou Ana ga Aku Hodo

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:55.620
I crush my thorny grip

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:55.620
Toge Darake no GRIP Nigiritsubushite

00:05:55.980 --> 00:06:01.390
and load bullets that look like ripe flowerbuds

00:05:55.980 --> 00:06:01.390
Osanai Mada Tsubomi no You na Dangan de

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:05.500
Let me shoot through the soul

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:05.500
Let me, shot through the soul

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:10.450
and dye it rose

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:10.450
Bara-iro ni Somare

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:40.930
Oh, you're awake,

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:42.430
Princess.

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:45.960
Still in pain?

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:47.040
Why don't you sleep some more?

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:52.410
Don't look at me like that.

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:53.500
Oh yeah.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:56.210
Do you want to know how I found you, Akira?

00:06:57.580 --> 00:06:58.590
No...

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:01.790
By smell.

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:03.750
Your smell.

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:09.140
Keisuke... You didn't take Line, did you?

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:15.460
It wasn't a smell like shampoo
or soap. It was better than that.

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:16.660
A scent to my liking.

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:21.380
Come on, say something. It wasn't easy.

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:23.590
Or do you want to hear it from me?

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:28.080
The me who you see now has done a great
deal of killing in such a short time.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:31.080
You did it?

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:32.420
Did what?

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:35.100
At the club in the neutral zone.

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:37.320
Yeah. That's right.

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:38.830
I did it.

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:41.110
I killed them all.

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:45.290
They were all weaklings.

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:46.820
And idiots on top of that.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:49.610
Idiots are idiots no
matter how many you kill.

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:52.100
Not like they had any reason for living.

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:54.440
I didn't really enjoy killing them anyway.

00:07:58.110 --> 00:08:00.010
Why do you look like that?

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:01.990
Did I say something weird?

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:08.870
Oh yeah, there was that guy
who tried to steal my tags.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:10.370
The one with blue hair.

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:19.010
I felt so bad that one time
when you had to save me.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:20.140
So...

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:25.800
I'm returning the favor now.

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:30.640
That's a great expression!

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:33.450
First time I've seen you look like that!

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.140
That guy...

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:38.480
He was near you.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:43.080
So, if I approached him, I
could pick up your scent.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:48.620
He was too stupid to learn his lesson.
I couldn't really do much about that.

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:51.200
But you know what?

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:54.380
His blood was really warm.

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:56.160
It felt great.

00:08:56.160 --> 00:09:00.460
I can still taste his blood in my mouth.

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:04.710
Hey, ain't I great?

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:07.590
Hey, Akira. Say something?

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:10.600
Why did you take Line?

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:13.830
What are you saying?

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:15.410
Don't you understand?

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:17.850
Didn't you want me to be like this?

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.480
How I...

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:21.280
Don't play dumb.

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:24.980
Didn't you want me to stand on my own
two feet and stop relying on you?

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:28.990
Didn't you want me to be
able to fend for myself?

00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:29.780
That's not it.

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:31.910
That's not what I wanted.

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:34.370
What then?

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:36.790
Is that why you took Line?

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.360
Isn't it the same for everyone?

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:43.600
They want to become strong and
obtain power, so they take Line.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:48.300
If you take it, your body
won't be able to withstand it.

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:52.790
Keisuke, you'll die.

00:09:55.310 --> 00:09:57.170
You know, Akira...

00:09:57.170 --> 00:09:59.480
You're pretty self-centered.

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:14.670
What did you say to me earlier?

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:16.750
That I annoy you, was it?

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:21.910
That's why I'm not gonna
abide by anyone's rules.

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:24.100
I'm gonna do it my way.

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:26.670
That's what you said.

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:29.400
Or am I mistaken?

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:32.680
Come on. Say something, Akira?

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:37.560
Do you hate me, Akira?

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:42.720
You always have that look in
your eyes when you look at me.

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:46.190
Have you been hanging out with me
just so you could look down on me?

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:50.610
Well, is that how it is, Akira?

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:52.530
No, you got it wrong!

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:54.520
Just one of your whims then?

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:56.800
When you're in a good mood,
you want to hang out together;

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.540
When you're in a bad mood, you toss me aside.

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:02.210
No...

00:11:03.570 --> 00:11:04.350
Whatever.

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:07.380
It's not worth it.

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:09.010
Anyway.

00:11:09.010 --> 00:11:12.340
I guess the face I want to
see from you the most...

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:18.020
...is your dying one, after all.

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:50.170
Hey! Do we have to take care
of all of these bodies?

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:52.430
Of course.

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:54.560
That's our job.

00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:56.890
Gosh.

00:11:56.890 --> 00:12:00.520
This isn't good for upholding
the rules of Igra.

00:12:00.520 --> 00:12:02.390
Go and find the culprit immediately!

00:12:02.390 --> 00:12:05.710
Huh? More overtime?

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:06.610
That's overkill!

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:08.200
Is that so?

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:11.810
The guy did all this. It could be fun.

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:13.390
Bet Mitsuko would be delighted, too.

00:12:14.780 --> 00:12:15.930
Reporting in.

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:19.170
What?

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:22.010
A Line abuser who died in odd circumstances?

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:38.110
My, my.

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:39.930
If this isn't...

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:55.060
How unsightly.

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:01.910
Ya seen this guy somewhere before?

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:03.310
Idiot.

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:05.480
He's the tag thief.

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:07.500
Was it this guy?

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:11.300
Can't see any blue on his
head... Just blood everywhere!

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:12.790
And?

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:15.760
This is the Line abuser whom
they say died of shock?

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:19.630
Yeah. He was fighting with a young man.

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:22.480
When he won, he licked the other man's blood.

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:23.520
And the moment he did that,
he was in great pain.

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:26.260
The moment he licked his blood?

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:33.920
Now now, don't do that!

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:34.930
You'll get filthy.

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:39.120
Blood that rejects Line. How interesting.

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:42.990
Is he in this picture?

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:44.870
Uh...

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:47.120
It's this one!

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:49.970
I see.

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:53.700
So it's about Project Nicole.

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:16.070
Akira!

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:18.030
Rin...

00:14:18.360 --> 00:14:19.730
So this is where you were.

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:21.680
What's the matter?

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:22.860
You look awful.

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:24.990
What happened to you?!

00:14:28.210 --> 00:14:29.270
H-Hey!

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:30.680
Akira, what's wrong?

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:31.750
Akira?!

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:43.560
Heave-ho!

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:47.060
I'm sorry, Rin.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:48.920
It's all right.

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:51.020
But what happened to you?

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:57.990
Keisuke got his hands on Line.

00:14:57.990 --> 00:14:59.080
Eh?

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:02.680
He killed those people in the club.

00:15:03.430 --> 00:15:04.380
That can't be...

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:09.880
I never noticed how he
was brooding over things.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:14.040
Even though he was right beside me.

00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:19.130
You're not the one to blame.
It's the drug's fault.

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:25.630
Even if it was your fault, I'm
the one who told him about Line.

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:30.560
But deep down inside, that's how
Keisuke always felt about me...

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:35.100
Well, you have to consider that a lot of
things happened when he got his hands on Line.

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:40.070
A lot of people lose sight
of themselves in this town.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:46.970
I can't claim to understand
Keisuke's feelings.

00:15:48.820 --> 00:15:49.940
I'm sorry.

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:51.070
Bad timing.

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:56.170
I'm gonna go and check the situation.

00:15:57.900 --> 00:15:58.340
Rin!

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:02.760
Where are you gonna go?

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:05.760
Well, several places.

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:09.470
Don't look at me like that.

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:11.320
I'll be fine.

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:19.180
After all, there are things I have
to do here in Toshima no matter what.

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:22.080
See ya, Akira.

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:23.370
Rin...

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:28.160
It's no good if you become like me.

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:41.770
Keisuke...

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:03.040
Is this for me?

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:22.380
I know this is sudden, but I would
like to invite you over for a meal.

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:27.420
It won't take long. Won't you give
me some of your precious time?

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:32.080
I would like to have a word with you about
your friend who you were with earlier.

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:36.890
You're welcome any time
as long as you come alone.

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:38.570
I'll be waiting.

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:39.980
Yours, Arbitro

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:10.340
To be dyed or not to be dyed by any color.

00:18:21.440 --> 00:18:24.640
Acquaintances. Responsibilities.
Understanding.

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:27.830
At times, these things
trickle out from the inside.

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:31.870
What do you think?

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:37.640
What are you talking about?

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:46.300
A man will come soon.

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.510
Please give this to him.

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:52.970
Just who are you?

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:56.870
Trying to look without seeing.

00:18:58.060 --> 00:19:01.700
There are things you can't see even if you
go to great lengths to try and see them.

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:04.190
Do you understand any of this?

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:11.450
If we meet again, I'd
like to hear your answer.

00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:43.460
Our spy in Toshima contacted us.

00:19:44.350 --> 00:19:45.230
Did he find him?

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:47.110
Seems he's come in contact with n.

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:52.970
He'll continue the surveillance
so we can capture n.

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:53.870
No...

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:55.780
Head over to Toshima.

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:57.490
But...

00:19:57.490 --> 00:19:59.950
There's no point in letting n slip away.

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:04.710
We're gathering intelligence
so we can capture n.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:07.700
This matter isn't open for discussion.

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:34.090
Have you been here for a long time?

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:39.280
Why do you have that thing?

00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:50.420
Did a man come here?

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:55.590
What a joke.

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:58.760
Did you look at what's inside it?

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:03.270
Do you know that man?

00:21:04.310 --> 00:21:05.830
I have something to ask you too!

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:07.020
Who the hell is he?

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:10.590
He is...

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:12.600
...fear.

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:14.950
Fear?

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:19.850
Forget all that you've witnessed here.

00:21:19.850 --> 00:21:20.700
Got that?

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:24.160
I don't recall agreeing
to take orders from you.

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:26.120
Then do you want to die here?

00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:37.030
There's no point in killing you.

00:23:51.950 --> 00:23:57.040
It's truly an honor to invite a
beautiful young man like you here.

00:23:57.040 --> 00:24:02.530
I'm very sorry, but I humbly decline
the entry of an ugly middle-aged man.

00:24:02.030 --> 00:24:04.660
Episode 8

00:24:02.530 --> 00:24:05.030
Please be sure to come alone.
